        "text": "In which the dimensionless sediment diameter (D*) can be calculated with the following formulation. The v is the kinematic viscosity based on the expression of Van Rijn and is a function of the water temperature. XBeach assumes a constant temperature of 20 degrees Celsius, this result in a constant kinematic viscosity of 10-6 m2/s."
